# CVE-2026-43871 - Apache Thrift denial of service (TCompactProtocol varint loop).
# Fixed in libthrift 0.24.0, which is incompatible with TDB2 in Jena 5.x; the fix
# needs Jena 6.2+, which rdf-pbac and jena-fuseki-kafka do not support yet.
# Accepted risk until the Jena 6 upgrade - remove this entry when that lands.
CVE-2026-43871
